Gen 20:1 , Abraham sojourns at Gerar;
Gen 20:2 , Denies his wife, who is taken by Abimelech;
Gen 20:3 , Abimelech is reproved for her in a dream;
Gen 20:9 , He rebukes Abraham;
Gen 20:14 , Restores Sarah;
Gen 20:16 , and reproves her;
Gen 20:17 , Abimelech and his family are healed at Abraham's prayer.
